            "id": 76965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1001</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why does this comparison print <code>True</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code> is greater than <code>1</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>&gt;</code> sign makes any two numbers equal.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The two numbers are joined to make <code>1001</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>100</code> is greater than <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 76964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>11</code> is greater than or equal to <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;</code>, followed by <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The two numbers are equal. Build the operator so the code prints <code>True</code> here, and would still print <code>True</code> if the left number were larger.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;</code>, followed by <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
