            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does <code>!=</code> do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It checks if a value isn't equal to another value</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It checks if a value is equal to another value</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It checks if a value is less than another value</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It checks if a value isn't equal to another value.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You need a comparison that becomes <code>True</code> when two values are different. What does <code>!=</code> do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It checks that one value is not equal to another value</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It checks that one value is equal to another value</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It checks that one value is less than another value</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It checks that one value is not equal to another value.</p></body></html>"
